{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X部分未标“到时出现”的感受仍然比较密集，上下交替的结构也不如Y左右分栏直观，局部快速扫读会稍费眼。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然信息更丰富，但【】突出心理转折的关键抓手，较小的感受文字和按音乐时点出现的提示又把阅读负担分散开了，观众不必一次读完所有细节。更重要的是，X把舍不得被当作自己人、忘不了受过的气、想念不等于回头这几层矛盾反复连接起来，人物为什么犹豫、怎样逐渐接受现实、最后如何继续生活，都有清楚的心理依据。Y更简洁直观，但部分关键区别被概括掉了，音乐情绪的变化也缺少X那样具体、连续的呈现。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "651f4357-56e5-4d51-b293-957014c2eafb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T053028224296Z", "elapsed_seconds": 101.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:32:09.670838+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0c86d28f4d2a1010f2e79cba2816ce3ff4e56ada4c8c6b049471369c94664e3b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\cha